That's too up-front!

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:25.650
There are too many books with incomprehensible, seemingly self-intoxicated titles.

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:33.470
Really, even titles which make you go “I see!” as you continue are confusing when brought up suddenly.

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:37.680
If they were a little bit easier to understand, it would be easier to become familiar with them.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.100
Like “Suzuka”!

